---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Happyranks privacy policy.">
  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="text-display-2 text-fg mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-fg-secondary leading-relaxed">
        <p><strong class="text-fg">Last updated:</strong> July 2026</p>
        <p>Happyranks ("we", "our", "us") respects your privacy. This page explains what data we collect, how we use it, and what choices you have.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg pt-6">Data we collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong class="text-fg">PULSE audit submissions:</strong> URL + email. We use the URL to scan your site and the email to send you the report.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-fg">Contact form submissions:</strong> name, email, company, website, budget, message.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-fg">Analytics:</strong> anonymized page views via privacy-respecting analytics. No cross-site tracking.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg pt-6">How we use it</h2>
        <p>To deliver the service you requested (audit report, contact response). To send occasional, relevant follow-ups — never spam. We do not sell or share your data with third parties.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg pt-6">Your rights</h2>
        <p>You can request deletion of your data at any time. Email <a href="mailto:hello@happyranks.com" class="text-[var(--color-brand)]">hello@happyranks.com</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg pt-6">Contact</h2>
        <p>Sanjeev · Happyranks · Coimbatore, India · <a href="mailto:hello@happyranks.com" class="text-[var(--color-brand)]">hello@happyranks.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
